SUMMARY:ARTbus:  Burlington and Oakville Galleries ($20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe've been attending these **ARTbus** 
 trips for many years. Not always able to get them posted on MEETUP-as they
  fill up quite quickly.\n\n$20 ticket link is below. Purchase your OWN tic
 ket when you RSVP on Meetup.\n\n**In partnership with the Art Gallery of B
 urlington\, Oakville Galleries invites you to join us for the Summer 2026 
 ARTbus.**\n\n(We rent a BUS--ok its a **yellow school bus**--but it works!
 ) Hence the $20 price!\n\n**$20 per person** at the *link below. (By signi
 ng up--signals to me that you've purchased your $20 ticket--LET me know vi
 a Meetup email)*\n\nWould you like to join in this next one/upcoming? **Sa
 turday June 13th.**\n\nThis will be incredible afternoon!! International a
 rtists.\n\n**BUS pickup and drop off is 5-10 walk from Bloor/Dufferin TTC*
 *\n\n**Contemporary Art Bus Tour**\n**SATURDAY June 13th (11:30am-6pm)**\n
 \nLet someone else DRIVE while we enjoy socializing and ART learning.\n\n*
 *Reserve your own seat ($20)** and enjoy an inspiring afternoon across thr
 ee leading art institutions.\n\n**TICKET link here (with all details)--**\
 n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/artbus_2026_summer\n\nPlease be on TI
 ME. Plan ahead.
